    "title": "Alostora - Live Scores",
    "description": "alostora is the sports application for the Arab people.\r\n\r\nFollow match summary, and follow the most important sports news up to date.\r\n\r\nYou will find everything you want about the matches and find out the dates, results and match schedule according to the date you want.\r\n\r\nYou can also see the tables, scorers and assists in all leagues, and you can also see who received yellow and red cards.\r\n\r\nThere is a profile for each league, team, and player, which displays all the information related to each league, team, and player.\r\n\r\nYou can choose the leagues you want to follow and also control the arrangement of those leagues so that the matches are displayed according to your desires. You can also add any tournament, team, or player to your favorites list to facilitate access to them.",
